Dark (Dark Souls III) -  Dark Souls III - mechanic - general_information 
 general_information : Dark is one of four elemental damage types in *Dark Souls III*, inflicted on and by certain enemies, items, weapons, and spells.

This element is generally ineffective against:
undead enemies affiliated with the darkness, such as Hollows and Skeletons;
beings corrupted by the Abyss like Aldrich, Devourer of Gods, Dragonslayer Armour, Abyss Watchers and Darkeater Midir;
cursed beings like Lorian, Elder Prince
Giant Slaves;

Dark damage is a common weakness among:
gods and their descendants like the Nameless King and the Dancer of the Boreal Valley
ancient beings and descendants of the gods such as Silver Knights, Black Knights, Pontiff Knights and Boreal Outrider Knights;
Winged Knights;
